  "xenv: cong⟨pt⟨3/4, -3/8⟩, pt⟨-1/2, 3/4⟩, pt⟨5/8, -1/2⟩, pt⟨-1/2, -1/8⟩⟩",
  "uenv: perp⟨pt⟨3, 0⟩, pt⟨2, 2⟩, pt⟨-1, 0⟩, pt⟨-4, -3⟩⟩",
