  "uenv: between⟨pt⟨4, 2⟩, pt⟨-2/3, 0⟩, pt⟨-3, -1⟩⟩",
  "uenv: same⟨rot⟨centroid⟨A, D, D⟩, midpoint⟨A, B⟩⟩, rot⟨fourth⟨A, A, B⟩, fourth⟨A, D, A⟩⟩⟩",
  "benv: rightangle⟨pt⟨3/4, 1/4⟩, pt⟨1/2, 1/4⟩, pt⟨1/2, 1/2⟩⟩",
  "xenv: rightangle⟨pt⟨3/4, 1/4⟩, pt⟨1/2, 1/4⟩, pt⟨1/2, 1/2⟩⟩ && rightangle⟨pt⟨1/2, 1/4⟩, pt⟨1/2, 1/2⟩, pt⟨3/4, 1/2⟩⟩ && rightangle⟨pt⟨1/2, 1/2",
  "uenv: dist2⟨A, B⟩ < 0",
  "uenv: par⟨A, B, A, B⟩",
  "defenv: dist2⟨A, B⟩ >= 0",
  "simpe benv: coshsq⟨pt⟨0, 0⟩, pt⟨1/2, 0⟩⟩",
  "tenv: ⟨⟨cl⟨cl⟨cl⟨A⟩⟩⟩⟩ᶜ⟩ᶜ = ⟨cl⟨⟨cl⟨cl⟨⟨cl⟨⟨A⟩ᶜ⟩⟩ᶜ⟩⟩⟩ᶜ⟩⟩ᶜ",
  "tenv: ⟨⟨cl⟨cl⟨cl⟨⟨cl⟨A⟩⟩ᶜ⟩⟩⟩⟩ᶜ⟩ᶜ = cl⟨⟨cl⟨⟨⟨⟨⟨cl⟨A⟩⟩ᶜ⟩ᶜ⟩ᶜ⟩ᶜ⟩⟩ᶜ⟩",
  "tenv proves? cl⟨cl⟨cl⟨⟨⟨⟨cl⟨cl⟨A⟩⟩⟩ᶜ⟩ᶜ⟩ᶜ⟩⟩⟩ ⊆ ⟨cl⟨⟨⟨⟨cl⟨cl⟨A⟩⟩⟩ᶜ⟩ᶜ⟩ᶜ⟩⟩ᶜ",
  "tenv: cl⟨⟨cl⟨⟨cl⟨⟨cl⟨⟨A⟩ᶜ⟩⟩ᶜ⟩⟩ᶜ⟩⟩ᶜ⟩ = cl⟨⟨cl⟨⟨A⟩ᶜ⟩⟩ᶜ⟩",
  "tenv: cl⟨A⟩ = int⟨A⟩",
  "tenv: A ⊆ cl⟨A⟩",
  "tenv: bd⟨A⟩ = bd⟨Aᶜ⟩",
  "menv: ε ⋆ z ⋆ y = x",
  "menv: y ⋆ ε ⋆ x ⋆ z ⋆ x = y ⋆ x",
  "menv: x ⋆ y ⋆ y = x ⋆ x ⋆ y ⋆ y ⋆ y",
  "menv: x ⋆ y = x ⋆ z => y = z",
  "menv: ε ⋆ x = x",
  "genv: inv⟨a⟩ · ⟨inv⟨c⟩ · c · ⟨a · b · c · inv⟨c⟩⟩ · inv⟨b · b⟩⟩ = ⟨inv⟨c⟩ · c · ⟨a · b · c · inv⟨c⟩⟩ · inv⟨b · b⟩⟩ · inv⟨a⟩",
  "genv: b · b · ⟨e⟩ · inv⟨b⟩ = b · inv⟨a⟩ · c",
  "senv: ⟨⟨A ∪ ⟨U ∩ U⟩⟩ ∩ ⟨⟨C \\ B⟩⟩ᶜ⟩ = ⟨⟨A ∪ ⟨U ∩ U⟩⟩ ∩ ⟨⟨C \\ B⟩⟩ᶜ⟩",
  "kenv: 3 * P⟨⟨A \\ C⟩⟩ + 1 * P⟨⟨⟨C \\ B⟩⟩ᶜ⟩ <= 1/2",
  "zenv: ⦃2⦄ ⊆ ⦃2, ∅⦄",
  "zenv: ⦃1, 2⦄ = ⦃1, 2, ∅⦄",
  "zenv: ⦃1, 2⦄ \\ ⦃1, 2, ∅⦄ = ∅",
  "zenv: card⟨⦃3⦄ ∪ ⦃2, 3⦄⟩ = 2",
  "eenv: k = k",
  "lenv: y ⊔ y = y",
  "lenv: ⟨⟨x ⊔ x⟩ ⊔ ⟨z ⊔ z⟩⟩ ⊔ ⟨⟨x ⊔ x⟩ ⊔ ⟨z ⊔ z⟩⟩ = ⟨⟨x ⊔ x⟩ ⊔ ⟨z ⊔ z⟩⟩"]
failedlabels in List(String) := filter((w in String |-> not isnil(w)), zipwith((ok in Bool |-> (name in String |-> if(ok, "", name))), checkvalues, checklabels))
main in String := if(isnil(failedlabels), "PASS 134", "FAIL " ++ unwords(failedlabels))
